## Quick start

1. Open the last Jenkins Cypress build.
2. Download `reports.zip` into your `Downloads` folder.
3. Open Claude Code in this repository.
4. Type:

   ```
   /cypress-nightlyreportaudit
   ```

5. Read the short summary in the terminal and open the dashboard link.
6. Answer the question: which fix to start with. The first one is the recommended one.
7. For each fix, read the proposed edit, then answer "yes" or "no".

### Useful variations

| You type | What happens |
|---|---|
| `/cypress-nightlyreportaudit` | Uses the newest `reports*` file in Downloads |
| `/cypress-nightlyreportaudit C:\path\to\reports` | Uses that report folder or zip |
| `/cypress-nightlyreportaudit investigate spec by spec` | Investigates every failing spec on its own and writes a detailed report |
 

